hi i'm ryan i'm a tasty producer and  today we are making pumpkin spice cookie  sandwiches inspired by the lg tasty  cookie kit just in time for the holidays  i am not an experienced baker i am an  amateur if you will when it comes to  baking i mainly  use  pre-mixed brownie boxes and cookie boxes  and so today for this video i'm trying  something a little bit different i'm  going to try and make these cookies from  scratch so thanks to the lg tasty cookie  kit the audience should be able to make  these cookies a lot quicker than i am  able to today  i hosted one thanksgiving besides that  i'm usually meeting up with family or  doing a friends giving and it isn't  until just recently that i've been  bringing something to contribute to the  meal before i was just some punk kid and  just ate whatever was there but now i  have these pumpkin spice cookie  sandwiches and i'm really excited to  contribute them to the next thanksgiving  get together i think baking and cooking  is the most stressful part of the  holidays but i'm definitely feeling less  stressed this year because of the lg  oven i have baked in a few different  ovens before and i've had varying  degrees of success some of them have  burned some of them just were mush and  didn't bake all the way through and so  it's really nice to have this oven  because it's so consistent  one thanksgiving we had a good deal of  pumpkin pies and there was one leftover  one full pie and the next morning i just  ate that entire pie for breakfast so  that sort of speaks to my love for  pumpkin i really love pumpkin i don't  know what it is  my sister introduced me to pumpkin spice  back  in my high school days she was getting a  lot of coffees and getting a lot of  pumpkin spice lattes and  for a while i was that basic boy who  just kept on getting pumpkin spice  lattes  i still am  that's so good  [Music]  [Music]
 

